abstract: "Analysis of the HHS Medicaid Provider Spending open dataset, ~11 GB covering Jan 2018 to Dec 2024: DuckDB queries the CSVs in place with Polars, scikit-learn z-score outlier detection, and Matplotlib/Seaborn charts of cost-per-claim and cost-per-beneficiary at provider x procedure x month grain."
